      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I also have something I’d like to see improved in the new avatar menu.\n\nSince the detailed menu is larger and easier to tap than the “Change Avatar” button, it’s quite confusing when trying to change my avatar.\n\nIn my personal avatar menu, I believe the “Change Avatar” button should be the most prominent one.\n\nI understand that this design was likely chosen to maintain consistency with the Avatar Marketplace, but in the context of the personal avatar menu, the primary action users want to take is to change their avatar.\n\nThat’s why I feel it would be more appropriate for that button to be the largest and most noticeable.\n\nAt any rate, it’s quite confusing as it is.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
