      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It is very stressful for me that every time I start the client, the initial tab in the avatar menu is Explore.\n\nI understand that VRChat wants the new feature to be used, but not everyone who opens the avatar menu does so to look for avatars in the marketplace. The users around me mainly use avatars that they have created themselves.\n\nI think it is up to the user to decide whether to use the Explore tab or the My Avatars tab as their main tab, so the state of the last tab opened should be retained, not lost every time the client is launched.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
