  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The new avatar menu is great and all, but there's a few things I think should definitely be worked out. A) The Recently Used tab doesn't automatically sort by recently used. Why? I don't know, but it should. B) I think a sort for something like Recently Favorited should exist so your favorites can go back in the order you had them from before the update. C) The design language doesn't match up at all with the rest of the menu tabs, from the buttons to the highlighting to the unnaturally small text.",
